      "x": 685,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 335,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "parse_sql_file() → sqlglot AST\n_check_quality_rules() 检查：\n  ⛔  UPDATE_WITHOUT_WHERE   (ERROR)\n  ⛔  DELETE_WITHOUT_WHERE   (ERROR)\n  ⚠️  SELECT_STAR             (WARNING)\n  ⚠️  TRUNCATE_TABLE          (WARNING)\n  ℹ️  DROP_WITHOUT_IF_EXISTS  (INFO)\n  ℹ️  CREATE_WITHOUT_IF_NOT_EXISTS (INFO)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
